                  Parameters for SPECSIM3D
                  ************************

START OF PARAMETERS:
0.5 0.5 0.5                   xmin ymin zmin  (coordinates of the first node)
1.0 1.0 1.0                   dx dy dz  (grid spacing)
64 64 16                      nx ny nz  (nodes per axis, nz = 1 gives a 2D field)
0.0 1                         nugget nstruct  (nugget variance, number of nested structures)
1 1.0 20 10 5 45.0 0.0 0.0    itype sill ahmax ahmin avert azimuth dip plunge  (itype: 1 spherical, 2 exponential, 3 gaussian)
31791191 20 0                 iseed nreal ipad  (random seed, number of realizations, ipad: 1 = padded periodic grid)
example_yao_spherical_legacy_grid
2                             nout  (number of outputs; one code per line follows)
4                             output code: 4 = one VTK XML file <base>.vti with all the realizations (ParaView opens it directly)
3                             output code: 3 = raw float32 file <base>.bin (realizations consecutive, x fastest)
0                             icond  (0 = unconditional simulation, 1 = conditional: the conditioning block follows)
